# The OpenAI SDK is deliberately NOT listed here: its graph is not hash-locked
# and lives in requirements-openai.txt, which the launcher and the build script
# install as a separate, unpinned step. Keeping it out of this file makes the
# declaration match what requirements-runtime.lock actually enforces.
